1
00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:05,130
Can you help me pick an engagement ring?
菲比，幫我挑訂婚戒指好嗎？ 

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:10,430
I can't figure this out. Should I get her a Tiffany cut or a princess cut or a..?
我覺得好難挑喔 我要選第凡內切割法還是… 公主方切割法還是…

4
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,970
Paper cut!
紙張切割法

5
00:00:13,910 --> 00:00:18,400
-Have you told anyone else? -No,I don't want Monica to find out.
你有告訴其他人嗎？ 沒有，我不想讓摩妮卡發現

7
00:00:18,610 --> 00:00:19,710
You told me.
可是你告訴我了

8
00:00:19,950 --> 00:00:22,280
Because I trust you and we're friends...
因為我信任你 你是我的死黨之一

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,350
and you saw me looking at ring brochures.
而且你在我看型錄時闖進來

10
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,790
Once again, not knocking pays off.
進房不敲門再次大有斬獲

11
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:32,720
-I wish you hadn't been on the toilet. -Me too.
如果你不是在蹲馬桶就好了 我有同感

12
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:36,530
Let me see. Is there such a thing as a Monica cut?
我看看，有摩妮卡切割法嗎？ 

13
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,000
Because that would be you best bet.
有的話就是它了

14
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:45,390
-Want to go to the coffeehouse? -Oh,all right.
錢德，要不要去喝咖啡？ 好啊 走吧

16
00:00:45,740 --> 00:00:48,110
We were just gonna see if you wanted to go.
太好了，我們正想找你們下去

17
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:51,740
Well,we don't because we got the other place.
不要，我們要去別家

18
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:56,950
How rude.
真沒禮貌

19
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:58,880
Sorry. Want a bite?
抱歉，你要吃嗎？

20
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:03,450
The One With The Ring
本集播出：「完美的戒指」

00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:05,450
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:01:38,790 --> 00:01:41,420
So how are things going with Paul?
你和保羅交往得怎樣？

22
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:42,690
Good.
很好

23
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:45,460
Although,you know, he's a private guy.
只不過他很內斂

24
00:01:45,670 --> 00:01:48,830
I wish I could get him to open up, share some feelings.
真想讓他稍微敞開心胸 分享心情

25
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:53,670
You just have to think of him as a jar of pickles that won't open.
簡單 把他想成打不開的罐子就對了

26
00:01:55,610 --> 00:01:59,600
I should run him under hot water and bang his head against a table?
你要我捉他的頭沖熱水敲桌子

27
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:04,470
That's what you do when you want to get the truth out of someone.
不是，那是拷問的手法

29
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:11,490
-Watch this. -Okay.
看我的 好

30
00:02:11,730 --> 00:02:13,250
-Hey,Paul. -Hi,Phoebe.
-保羅  -菲比

31
00:02:13,530 --> 00:02:15,260
How are things going with you?
你最近好嗎？

32
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,660
Can't complain.
沒得抱怨

33
00:02:23,010 --> 00:02:24,260
Let's go！
走吧

34
00:02:26,340 --> 00:02:29,140
-Great to.. -Ross,good to see you too.
-很高興...  -我也很高興見到你

35
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,940
You take care.
保重

36
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:39,840
What was the deal with you and Chandler blowing us off before?
你們剛才為什麼見到我們就跑

37
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:41,850
That was so weird,huh?
很怪吧？

38
00:02:43,460 --> 00:02:44,580
Why did you do it?
菲比，為什麼？

39
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:48,260
I didn't do it. It was Chandler.
不是我，是錢德

40
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,750
He's mad at you.
他…他在生你們的氣

41
00:02:51,400 --> 00:02:54,930
-What? Why? -Oh,please. I think you know why.
-什麼？ 為什麼？ -拜託，你明知故問

42
00:02:55,940 --> 00:02:57,530
I can't think of anything.
我想不起來

43
00:02:57,770 --> 00:03:01,400
Come on. You're a paleontologist. Dig a little deeper.
羅斯，你是古生物學家 再往下挖

44
00:03:04,210 --> 00:03:08,480
Is it because Joey and I didn't invite him to that Knicks game?
等等，是不是因為兩個星期前 喬伊和我沒找他去看球？

45
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:12,050
Is that something he'd be mad at you for?
你覺得他會為這種事生氣嗎？

46
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:15,990
-I guess it could. -Well,then I think that's it.
應該會 那就是羅

47
00:03:16,930 --> 00:03:21,330
If he's angry, he shouldn't hide it. I wish he'd just tell me the truth.
他不該隱瞞他的情緒 他應該老實告訴我

48
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:26,620
You should run him under hot water and bang his head against the table.
那你應該捉他的頭 去沖熱水敲桌子

49
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:32,610
Honey,I made a reservation at China Garden. Is that okay?
我在「中國花園」訂了位 可以嗎？

50
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,140
Yeah,that's great.
可以啊，很棒

51
00:03:34,410 --> 00:03:38,510
But first,talk to me. Talk to me. Tell me about your day.
但你先跟我說說話 說說你今天好不好

52
00:03:39,250 --> 00:03:40,710
It was fine.
蠻好的

53
00:03:42,350 --> 00:03:43,340
Okay.
好吧

54
00:03:45,420 --> 00:03:47,790
What are you thinking right now?
你在想什麼？你現在在想什麼

55
00:03:48,020 --> 00:03:51,620
That you are looking really fine in that dress.
我在想你穿這件裙子很好看

56
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:54,990
Yeah, that's great, Paul. But, you know....
太好了，但是…

57
00:03:55,930 --> 00:03:58,830
I want to know what.. Wow, those are really great!
我想知道…哇，好結實

58
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,170
I just want to know...
我想知道...

59
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:07,530
what is behind this strong, silent exterior?
這堅強沉默的外表下 隱藏著什麼

60
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:12,640
They say that still waters run deep, and I want to swim in yours.
俗語說靜水深流 我想在你的心中暢遊

61
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,440
Are you talking about having sex?
你在講做愛的事嗎？

62
00:04:18,150 --> 00:04:19,620
No, Paul.
不是

63
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:24,520
I don't know anything about you. Tell me about your childhood.
我一點也不瞭解你 例如你的童年，聊聊你的童年

65
00:04:24,790 --> 00:04:26,020
Normal.
很普通

66
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:30,820
Then how about puberty? Come on! That's always a painful time.
好，那青春期呢？ 青春期總是很討厭

67
00:04:31,070 --> 00:04:34,830
Your friends have a slumber party and stick your hand in warm water...
朋友找你去過夜聊天 趁你睡著把你的手放進熱水裡 

69
00:04:35,070 --> 00:04:37,900
while you sleep, so you pee in your sleeping bag.
害你在睡袋裡撒尿

70
00:04:40,140 --> 00:04:42,010
No,that never happened to me.
我沒碰過那種事

71
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:46,270
You're lucky you never met that bitch, Sharon Majeski.
那是你走運 沒碰上那個賤人莎朗麥傑斯基

72
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:48,270
Anyway...
總之… 

73
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:52,080
The rest of your life. Any regrets?
其他時期有什麼悔恨嗎？

74
00:04:53,050 --> 00:04:54,210
Nope.
沒有

75
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:57,150
I'm not asking for a lot here.
保羅，我要求得不多

76
00:04:57,390 --> 00:05:00,490
Just give me something. Anything.
你就講一件事，什麼事都好

77
00:05:01,530 --> 00:05:03,390
-Okay. -Okay.
好吧

78
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:10,070
When I was 6 years old, I wanted a Big Wheel.
6歲那年 我想要一輛大腳踏車

79
00:05:10,440 --> 00:05:13,200
And instead,my parents got me this little...
我父母卻送我一個...

80
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:17,540
plastic chicken that you hop around on.
小雞造型的跳跳樂

81
00:05:17,710 --> 00:05:20,040
It was embarrassing. Kids made fun of me.
糗死了，小朋友都笑我

82
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,040
That was a tough year.
那一年蠻痛苦的

83
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:25,720
That's great! See?
太好了，你看吧 

84
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:29,250
I already feel like I know you a little better.
我覺得我比較瞭解你了，謝謝

85
00:05:29,460 --> 00:05:32,190
Okay,come on. Now we can go eat. Let's go!
好，我們去吃飯吧

86
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:36,090
It was horrible.
我好慘

87
00:05:39,370 --> 00:05:41,560
They called me "Chicken Boy."
大家都叫我雞弟弟

88
00:05:49,280 --> 00:05:52,410
In fifth grade,I got in a fight. Well, not really.
五年級我跟別人打架 其實也不算打架

89
00:05:52,610 --> 00:05:54,340
Richard Danville bit me.
理查達倫咬我的鼻子

90
00:05:54,580 --> 00:05:58,110
I still have a little scar right here. You can see it.
我摔倒 這裡留了一個小疤 

92
00:05:58,390 --> 00:06:00,550
Yeah,yeah. I see the scar.
有，我看見了

93
00:06:00,760 --> 00:06:05,750
I think this is really great that, you know, you've shared your feelings.
保羅，你聽我說 你這樣分享你的心情真的很棒

94
00:06:05,990 --> 00:06:07,860
It's really... It's beautiful.
真的很..好

95
00:06:08,060 --> 00:06:11,400
But what do you say we go share some food?
那我們現在去吃飯吧

96
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:13,260
No,I couldn't eat now.
我現在吃不下

97
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:17,270
What are you talking about? You love their Kung Pao chicken!
你在說什麼？ 你最愛吃宮保雞丁了

98
00:06:18,910 --> 00:06:19,930
Chicken?
雞？

99
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:27,010
-Chicken Boy! -I'm sorry. I didn't mean to do that.
雞弟弟 天哪，對不起，我不是故意的

100
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:38,750
This is the nine millionth ring store, and I can't find the perfect ring.
一無所獲 逛了幾百家店 還是找不到完美的戒指

102
00:06:38,990 --> 00:06:42,390
Ugly ring, ugly ring, ugly ring...
丑，丑，丑

103
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:47,260
It's a beautiful selection.
這些戒指真美

104
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:53,700
So maybe you don't get her a ring. Maybe you do something different.
不然你不要送戒指 送點不一樣的

106
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:57,170
An engagement bracelet or an engagement tiara!
例如訂婚手鐲，或是訂婚頭飾

107
00:06:58,950 --> 00:07:02,280
An engagement Revolutionary War musket!
訂婚獨立戰爭毛瑟槍

108
00:07:03,550 --> 00:07:06,650
I'm so glad I picked you to help me with this.
真高興我是選你來幫忙

109
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,860
Imagine getting down on one knee...
你能不能想像你單膝跪下

110
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:12,420
and handing her this gorgeous piece of weaponry?
把這件漂亮的火器交給她？

111
00:07:13,530 --> 00:07:15,360
I'll stick with the ring.
我還是送戒指好了

112
00:07:17,570 --> 00:07:19,760
This one's nice. I like it. Sir?
這只好漂亮，我喜歡這只

113
00:07:19,930 --> 00:07:22,490
Kind sir, can I see this one?
先生？大哥？我想看這枚戒指

114
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:26,500
This is why you brought me. I know how to haggle.
你找我來就是因為我會講價

115
00:07:26,740 --> 00:07:30,070
-Let me handle this from here. -Can I help you?
所以接下來交給我處理  有什麼需要嗎？

117
00:07:30,340 --> 00:07:33,710
-I would like to see that ring. -Or not. Whatever.
有，我想看那枚戒指 或是不看，隨便

119
00:07:35,180 --> 00:07:36,880
This ring is from the 1920s.
這是一隻20年代的戒指 

120
00:07:37,150 --> 00:07:40,450
It's a one and a half carat diamond with sapphires.
1.5克拉，兩側鑲有藍寶石

121
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:42,320
Sir, could I ask you...?
先生，你能不能…

122
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:46,760
Could you hold out that ring and ask me to marry you?
拿著戒指向我求婚？

123
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:50,220
-Okay. -Okay.
好

124
00:07:52,100 --> 00:07:53,500
Will you marry me?
你願意嫁給我嗎？

125
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,900
Oh, my God, that's it! That's the ring!
天哪，就是它了

126
00:07:58,470 --> 00:08:00,740
-How much is it? -I will handle this.
-多少錢？ -錢德，讓我來

127
00:08:01,110 --> 00:08:02,740
How much is it?
多少錢？

128
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,000
$8600.
8千6

129
00:08:05,250 --> 00:08:07,540
We will give you $10.
我們出10塊錢

130
00:08:09,220 --> 00:08:11,410
-Are you interested in this ring? -Yes.
-你到底想不想買？ -想，想

131
00:08:11,690 --> 00:08:13,710
But I can only pay $8000.
但我只能出8千

132
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:18,350
-Okay. I can let it go for 8. -We stand firm at $10.
-好，8千可以 -我們堅持10塊錢

133
00:08:19,060 --> 00:08:21,360
-How would you like to pay? -Credit card.
您要怎麼付帳？ --刷卡

134
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:24,120
Oh,no! I lent my credit card to Joey.
不對，我的卡在喬伊那邊

135
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:26,530
I'll go get it. You guard the ring.
我回去拿，你守住戒指

136
00:08:26,770 --> 00:08:30,100
-Why did you give your credit card to Joey? -To buy some Knicks tickets.
-你為什麼把你的卡給喬伊？ -他要買尼克隊的球票

138
00:08:30,270 --> 00:08:34,040
Then the jerk didn't even invite me to the game. But I'm over it. Whatever!
結果他居然沒有找我一起去  不過我已經不在意了

140
00:08:37,350 --> 00:08:39,710
Listen, I'm sorry about before.
剛才很抱歉

141
00:08:39,980 --> 00:08:42,310
Do you have anything here for $10?
你們有10塊錢的東西嗎？

142
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:45,640
Yes. I have these two rather beautiful...
有，我有兩張嶄新的...

143
00:08:45,890 --> 00:08:48,320
five-dollar bills.
5元鈔票

144
00:08:50,460 --> 00:08:52,690
I'll give you $1 for them.
我出1塊錢跟你買

145
00:08:55,300 --> 00:08:58,490
Remember how Chandler and Phoebe blew us off yesterday?
昨天錢德和菲比 不是看到我們就跑？

146
00:08:58,830 --> 00:09:00,030
No.
有嗎？

147
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:04,790
-Remember,you were eating pizza? -Yeah.
你當時在吃披薩 喔對

149
00:09:06,110 --> 00:09:11,200
Chandler's angry at us for not getting him a ticket to that Knicks game.
錢德顯然是在氣我們2星期前 沒幫他買球票

150
00:09:11,610 --> 00:09:16,710
We were supposed to just get him one? That guy's always mooching off of us.
我們為什麼要幫他買票？ 那傢伙老是揩我們的油 就是啊

152
00:09:18,390 --> 00:09:22,320
Anyway,I still think we should try to patch things up.
但我還是覺得應該設法和解

153
00:09:22,560 --> 00:09:25,720
We could get tickets to another game and invite him.
我們可以找他去看另一場球賽

154
00:09:25,990 --> 00:09:30,020
That's a great idea. And I still have his credit card.
好主意 而且他的卡還在我這裡

155
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,590
Here you go.
帳單

156
00:09:31,770 --> 00:09:34,890
Hey,hey. I got this one. Here you go.
我有卡，拿去吧

157
00:09:35,940 --> 00:09:38,570
Sometimes I just don't get Chandler.
有時候我真搞不懂錢德

158
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:43,370
We do stuff all the time without you, and you don't get all upset.
我和他做很多事都沒找你 你也不會生氣

159
00:09:45,910 --> 00:09:48,380
-All the time? -All the time.
很多事？ 可多了

160
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:52,010
I'm sorry,it was rejected.
抱歉，這張卡不能刷

161
00:09:52,190 --> 00:09:54,850
That's impossible. Let me see that.
不可能，我看看

162
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:57,810
This one's mine. Here you go.
這張是我的，拿去吧

163
00:09:58,860 --> 00:10:01,230
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
我的天哪  我的天哪

164
00:10:02,330 --> 00:10:05,320
-Still crying? -Like a little girl.
還在哭？ 跟小女生一樣

165
00:10:07,130 --> 00:10:09,690
I know,I know. This is all my fault.
我知道…都是我不好

166
00:10:09,940 --> 00:10:11,700
I wanted him to open up.
是我要他敞開心胸的

167
00:10:11,940 --> 00:10:14,500
I didn't know that I was gonna unleash...
但是我不知道我會放出一頭...

168
00:10:14,740 --> 00:10:18,740
this weepy,clingy, moist monster!
哭哭啼啼又黏人的怪物

169
00:10:19,350 --> 00:10:23,680
I only know of two ways to shut a man up. One of them is sex.
有兩個辦法能讓一個男人閉嘴 其中一個是性愛

171
00:10:24,250 --> 00:10:27,240
-What's the other? -Don't know. Never had to use it.
-另一個是什麼？ -不知道，我只用過第一個

172
00:10:28,390 --> 00:10:32,020
I'm just saying, if we're having sex, he's not talking.
我只是說做愛的時候 他就不能講話

173
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:34,450
That's right. You're the talker.
沒錯，話多的是你

174
00:10:38,370 --> 00:10:39,920
Anyway, great idea.
總之這個主意很棒

175
00:10:40,900 --> 00:10:43,390
I gotta buy him some more tissues.
我要去商店 我答應去幫他買面紙

176
00:10:43,670 --> 00:10:45,870
-We have some here. -No,you don't!
-我們這裡有… -你們沒有

177
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:53,180
Okay. I'd also like to try on the tiara.
好，我還想試戴頭飾

178
00:10:55,180 --> 00:10:56,740
Oh,yeah. Okay.
太好了

179
00:10:59,190 --> 00:11:02,090
What do you think? Too much?
怎麼樣？太花了？

180
00:11:02,920 --> 00:11:04,410
A tad.
有一點 

181
00:11:05,930 --> 00:11:08,190
Take the tiara back...
把頭飾放回去

182
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:11,100
and let me hold the musket again.
毛瑟槍再給我一次

183
00:11:19,310 --> 00:11:21,300
Something's missing.
少了點什麼…

184
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:24,780
Let me see the ring that my friend picked out.
把我朋友挑的戒指拿給我

185
00:11:25,910 --> 00:11:30,650
-Where's the 1920s princess-cut ring? -I just sold it to that gentleman.
-那枚20年代的鑽戒呢？ -剛剛賣給那位先生

187
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:32,580
Oh,my God!
完蛋了

188
00:11:32,820 --> 00:11:34,450
Wait,no!
等等，別走

189
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:41,120
Let me out! Now!
放我出去，快點

190
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,840
Rachel?
瑞秋…

191
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,400
No.
不是

192
00:11:57,480 --> 00:12:00,170
-How are you, Paul? -Okay.
保羅，你好嗎？ 還好

193
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,420
Chandler...
錢德…

194
00:12:07,760 --> 00:12:11,560
-did your dad ever hug you? -No. Did he hug you?
-你爸抱過你嗎？  -沒有，他抱過你嗎？

195
00:12:12,990 --> 00:12:14,590
No! No.
不是

196
00:12:14,860 --> 00:12:17,990
It's just that my dad never did.
只不過我爸都沒抱過我

197
00:12:19,870 --> 00:12:20,890
I miss my dad.
我好想念我爸

198
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:24,360
You can see my dad in Vegas kissing other dads.
你可以去賭城 看我爸親別人的爸爸

199
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,870
-Hey,Chandler? -Yeah?
錢德？ 怎樣？

200
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,610
Would you...?
你能不能…

201
00:12:38,850 --> 00:12:40,010
Would you hug me?
你能不能抱我？

202
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:45,880
-I'm a little busy here, Paul. -That's what my dad used to say.
-我有點忙  -我爸也都這麼說

204
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:49,460
Okay. A quick one. Come on, hug it out.
好啦，一下下，快點

205
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:53,000
There you go.
行了吧

206
00:12:54,140 --> 00:12:55,690
Okay.
好了

207
00:12:56,140 --> 00:12:58,200
-Five more seconds.. -Okay!
-再5秒鐘 -夠了

208
00:13:00,010 --> 00:13:02,370
-Joey! -What? Hey, what..?
-喬伊  -什麼？

209
00:13:06,150 --> 00:13:08,210
Hi. Paul,is it?
保羅是吧？

210
00:13:09,350 --> 00:13:12,110
-Do you have my credit card? -Yeah. It's in my...
我的信用卡在嗎？ 在，在我的…

211
00:13:12,350 --> 00:13:13,980
In my pocket.
我的口袋裡

212
00:13:17,730 --> 00:13:19,420
-My back pocket! -Thank God.
-後面的口袋 -幸好

213
00:13:21,230 --> 00:13:24,630
-I got tickets to the Knicks tonight. -I can't go.
-我買了今天晚上尼克隊的票 -我不能去 

214
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:25,990
It'll be fun.
去啦，多好玩啊

215
00:13:26,230 --> 00:13:30,730
Me, you, Ross and Paul, probably.
我，你，羅斯和… 保羅嗎？

216
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:35,040
Look, I don't have time for this, okay? I gotta go.
我沒空好嗎，我得走了

217
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:41,840
That was mean.
好惡劣喔

218
00:13:43,280 --> 00:13:44,810
Yeah,I know.
就是啊

219
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:48,020
-Get in here. -Yeah.
過來吧 好

220
00:13:52,290 --> 00:13:54,630
Chandler, I found the perfect ring.
錢德，我找到最完美的戒指了

221
00:13:54,900 --> 00:13:57,690
I'm gonna go with the one I picked first.
真不錯 但我還是買之前那款好了

222
00:13:57,930 --> 00:14:01,700
Oh, wake up. The one you picked is gone. It's over!
天哪，錢德，那枚戒指不在了

223
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,430
What?
什麼？

224
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:08,130
Some guy bought it. I tried to stop him, but they put me in jail!
被一個人買走了，對不起 我想攔住他，卻被關進監獄裡

226
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:13,310
-They put you in jail? -The little jail between the doors!
-被關進監獄裡？ -門和門中間的小監獄

227
00:14:13,610 --> 00:14:16,780
-I asked you to guard the ring! -I know. I'm sorry.
-菲比，我要你守著那枚戒指 -我知道，對不起

228
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:20,950
But this ring is better. And Monica never saw the other ring.
但是這枚比較好 摩妮卡根本沒看過另一枚

229
00:14:21,220 --> 00:14:25,680
Yeah,but when he proposed to me with the ring, I got goosebumps.
但是他用那枚戒指向我求婚時 我起了雞皮疙瘩

230
00:14:26,530 --> 00:14:28,890
-Maybe it was the guy. -It was the ring!
-也許是因為那個人 -是因為那枚戒指

231
00:14:31,770 --> 00:14:35,760
-Was he excited about the tickets? -No! He blew us off!
-他興奮嗎？ -不，他回絕了

233
00:14:36,040 --> 00:14:38,030
-What? -I know.
什麼？ 就是啊

234
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:40,100
I can't believe it.
真是太扯了

235
00:14:40,610 --> 00:14:42,410
Can I tell you something?
告訴你

236
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:45,100
I'm a little mad at him now!
我現在有點氣他

237
00:14:46,580 --> 00:14:48,450
Can I tell you something?
告訴你

238
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,570
Me too!
我也是

239
00:14:53,950 --> 00:14:56,860
He didn't want to talk to us about being angry.
他生氣不告訴我們

240
00:14:57,090 --> 00:14:59,580
Maybe we don't talk to him at all!
那我們也不要告訴他

241
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:03,800
-Freeze him out. -Right!
-把他打入冷宮  -沒錯

242
00:15:04,060 --> 00:15:05,500
-I like it. -We'll show him.
-我喜歡 -給他好看

243
00:15:05,770 --> 00:15:09,760
From now on,it's gonna be Joey and Ross, best friends.
以後就是喬伊與羅斯 最佳拍檔

244
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,940
We'll be the new Joey and Chandler.
我們將是新的喬伊與錢德

245
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,270
What?
什麼？ 

246
00:15:17,810 --> 00:15:21,370
You think you and Chandler were closer than me and Chandler?
你覺得你和錢德比我和錢德更好？

247
00:15:21,550 --> 00:15:23,570
Hey, don't get angry.
別生氣

248
00:15:23,750 --> 00:15:26,780
We turn on each other, he wins.
我們一反目，他就贏了

249
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:33,960
Hi,I'm back.
我回來了

250
00:15:34,130 --> 00:15:36,120
I've written down more to tell you!
我把我想說的話都寫下來了

251
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:38,190
Oh,that's great.
真好

252
00:15:39,930 --> 00:15:42,560
No,actually,that's...
真是太好了

253
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:45,360
That's great. That's really great.
真的好棒

254
00:15:45,610 --> 00:15:50,010
You know,I gotta tell you, writing, all that writing, it gets me...
說真的，寫東西會燃起…

255
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:53,040
It gets me kind of hot.
我的慾火

256
00:15:53,280 --> 00:15:55,710
Wait, wait. Listen to this:
等等，你聽喔

257
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,450
Know what I wanted to be at that age?
你知道我小時候想當什麼？

258
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:01,110
A lover?
情聖？

259
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:03,590
-A surfer. -A surfer?
-衝浪者 -是嗎？

260
00:16:04,160 --> 00:16:07,420
-I wanted to be one with the waves.. -Hold on.
-我想與海浪為伍  -等等，等一下

262
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:12,060
Let me just get a little more comfortable here.
讓我把自己弄得舒服一點

264
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:13,320
Wait a second.
等一下

265
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:16,660
-This isn't too revealing,is it? -No.
-這樣會不會太露了？  -不會

266
00:16:17,470 --> 00:16:20,440
Whatever happened to that little dude?
當年那個小傢伙呢？

267
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:23,230
So full of dreams.
充滿夢想…

268
00:16:25,410 --> 00:16:29,080
I don't care about the little dude!
我不在乎那個小傢伙

269
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:32,540
I can't! I cannot listen to any more of this!
我聽不下去了

270
00:16:32,790 --> 00:16:36,150
The only one who'd listen is a mental health professional!
只有心理醫師會想聽這些話

271
00:16:36,420 --> 00:16:38,690
That's only because they get $100 an hour!
那還是因為他們1小時賺1百

272
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:42,950
Do you know how much money I could have made listening to you? $2000!
你知道我聽到現在可以賺多少  2千塊！

274
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:46,170
Know when I figured that out? While you were talking!
你知道我什麼時候算出來的？ 在你碎碎念的時候

275
00:16:47,130 --> 00:16:51,260
I can't believe you're trying to stifle me when 14 hours ago...
你居然想扼殺我的情緒 14個小時前...

277
00:16:51,510 --> 00:16:55,000
we figured out that's what my mother was trying to do!
我們才發現那就是我媽的目的

278
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:57,840
I'm sorry.
對不起 

279
00:16:58,080 --> 00:17:01,810
I don't mean... I didn't mean to stifle you.
我不是想扼殺你的情緒

280
00:17:02,380 --> 00:17:05,350
This is all just a little overwhelming.
我只是有點受不了

282
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:09,720
I'm so sorry.
瑞秋，對不起

283
00:17:10,620 --> 00:17:12,320
I didn't mean to overwhelm you.
我不是故意的 

284
00:17:12,590 --> 00:17:15,390
It's just that when those gates open...
只不過情緒一發洩

285
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:19,530
it's hard to close them.
就會…不可收拾

286
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,530
But they are closed now. Believe me.
不過現在沒事了，真的

287
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:28,500
I'm so glad. I'm so glad you shared.
我很高興你跟我分享你的心情

288
00:17:29,010 --> 00:17:31,640
And I'm glad that you're done.
也很高興你分享完了

289
00:17:34,150 --> 00:17:36,410
So what do you say we....
那我們要不要…

290
00:17:38,650 --> 00:17:39,880
I'd like that.
我求之不得

291
00:17:51,700 --> 00:17:55,190
That was so good!
真是…太棒了

292
00:18:04,550 --> 00:18:06,040
Oh,oh.

293
00:18:09,220 --> 00:18:13,520
I can't believe you talked me into this gumball-machine-looking ring.
我居然聽你的話 買下這枚造型廉價的戒指

294
00:18:13,920 --> 00:18:17,520
It's not a gumball-machine-looking ring. It's a beautiful ring!
它才沒有造型廉價，它很漂亮

295
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:19,210
No, it's not.
它才不漂亮

296
00:18:19,460 --> 00:18:23,060
When I looked at the other ring, I could see Monica's face...
另一枚戒指 會讓我看到摩妮卡的表情

297
00:18:23,260 --> 00:18:27,100
and I could see her saying yes. Looking at this,I only see a ring.
我會看到她點頭答應 這枚戒指只讓我看到一枚戒指

299
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:31,700
Unless I look at it really closely, and then I can see my own eye.
只有近看才會看到我自己的眼睛

300
00:18:36,480 --> 00:18:41,470
This is the most important thing I'll ever do. I want to make it perfect.
這是我這輩子最重要的一件事 我想做到最完美

301
00:18:42,550 --> 00:18:45,250
Maybe we could get the other ring back.
我們或許能把那枚戒指要回來

302
00:18:45,490 --> 00:18:48,220
I heard where the guy was gonna propose.
我偷聽到那個人準備求婚的地方

303
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:52,220
-Maybe we could get him to trade rings. -I can't do that.
-或許我們可以說服他交換  -我不能這麼做

304
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:55,920
You certainly can't give her that stupid gumball ring.
你總不能給她那枚廉價的戒指

306
00:18:56,130 --> 00:19:00,120
-All right. Where was he going? -Yeah,it's a restaurant...
-好吧，他要去哪裡？ -一家餐廳…

308
00:19:00,500 --> 00:19:02,590
-The Rainbow something. -Rainbow Room? -No.
-彩虹什麼的  -彩虹餐廳？ -不是

309
00:19:03,170 --> 00:19:04,160
-Rainbow Grill? -No.
-彩虹燒烤？ -不是

310
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:06,330
Somewhere Over the...?
彩虹的彼端？（電影「綠野仙蹤」主題曲）

312
00:19:07,770 --> 00:19:09,440
-L'Espace. -Rainbow L'Espace!
-空間  -彩虹空間？ 

313
00:19:09,610 --> 00:19:11,600
No,just L'Espace.
不是，只有空間

314
00:19:13,250 --> 00:19:16,550
I'd love to know how you got from rainbow to L'Espace.
你是怎麼從彩虹跳到空間的

315
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,450
No, you wouldn't.
你不會想知道的

316
00:19:19,290 --> 00:19:21,810
You don't wanna get in here.
我的思路很複雜

317
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,200
There he is.
就是他

318
00:19:31,370 --> 00:19:34,160
He hasn't proposed yet. She has no ring on.
好，他還沒求婚 因為她沒有戴戒指

319
00:19:34,430 --> 00:19:38,300
Wow, you're good! After this, we should solve crimes.
你真行，我們應該去當偵探 

320
00:19:38,670 --> 00:19:39,800
Okay. Go get him.
沒錯 去請他過來 

321
00:19:40,470 --> 00:19:41,570
Oh,okay.
好

322
00:19:44,340 --> 00:19:48,180
Excuse me. Could you come with me? You have a phone call.
抱歉，請您來一下 有您的電話

323
00:19:48,950 --> 00:19:50,920
-Who is it? -It's your office.
是誰？ 是你的公司打來的

324
00:19:51,250 --> 00:19:53,550
-Do you know who at my office? -John.
-你知道是誰嗎？ -約翰？ 

325
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,780
Oh,John! Great!
約翰啊，太好了

326
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:00,420
-There he is. -Hi. Okay.
-他來了 -你好

327
00:20:00,690 --> 00:20:02,630
There was a mix-up at the store.
珠寶店搞錯了

328
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:06,200
The ring you have was supposed to be held for me.
他們把為我保留的戒指賣給你

329
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:08,590
I'm gonna need to have that back.
所以我得跟你要回來

330
00:20:10,600 --> 00:20:15,370
In exchange, I'm willing to trade you this beautiful, more expensive ring.
不過我願意拿這枚美麗的 更昂貴的戒指和你交換

331
00:20:17,610 --> 00:20:19,410
Wow, I would trade.
要是我就換

332
00:20:20,950 --> 00:20:24,410
It is beautiful, but I'm gonna use this one. Excuse me.
的確很美，但是我要用這一枚 失陪了

333
00:20:24,650 --> 00:20:28,020
This is my fiancee, and her heart was set on that ring.
不，這位是我的未婚妻 她就是要這枚戒指

335
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:29,950
Do you want to break her heart?
你不會想傷她的心吧？

336
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:33,650
Yeah. Do you want to break a dying woman's heart?
對啊 你想傷一位垂死女人的心嗎？

337
00:20:34,600 --> 00:20:36,030
You're dying?
你要死了？

338
00:20:39,570 --> 00:20:41,120
Yeah,she's dying...
她快死於…

339
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:43,560
of a cough,apparently.
咳嗽了

340
00:20:45,440 --> 00:20:49,570
It's my dying wish to have that ring. If I'm not buried with it...
對，我臨死前想擁有那枚戒指 要是不能戴著它入土 

342
00:20:49,810 --> 00:20:52,900
my spirit will wander the netherworld..
我會變成孤魂野鬼在陰間…

343
00:20:53,110 --> 00:20:54,270
That's enough!
夠了，親愛的

344
00:20:55,950 --> 00:20:57,640
Oh,I don't know.
我不曉得

345
00:20:59,690 --> 00:21:02,480
-Let me see it. -Great. Okay, here.
-再讓我看一次  -當然，請看

346
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:07,550
-All right,I'll do it. -Thank you.
-好吧  -謝謝，謝謝，謝謝

348
00:21:07,790 --> 00:21:10,960
And you are about to marry a wonderful man.
你即將嫁給一個大好人

349
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:19,170
Hey, I'm marrying a dead woman!
我要娶一個死人

350
00:21:25,980 --> 00:21:27,000
Guys?
兄弟們？

351
00:21:30,580 --> 00:21:33,450
I've got something important to tell you.
我有大事要宣佈

352
00:21:34,190 --> 00:21:35,450
Guys?
兄弟們？

353
00:21:36,990 --> 00:21:38,150
Guys?
兄弟們？

354
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:39,830
Guys?
兄弟們？

355
00:21:41,660 --> 00:21:43,990
I'm gonna ask Monica to marry me.
我要跟摩妮卡求婚了

356
00:21:46,330 --> 00:21:48,800
I think we gotta end the freeze-out.
我們應該讓他從冷宮出來

357
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:52,970
Wait. Is this for real?
等等，你是來真的？

358
00:21:53,210 --> 00:21:55,040
Yeah. Check out the ring.
對，戒指在這裡

359
00:21:55,840 --> 00:21:57,970
Oh,my God!
天哪

360
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:01,310
So you two are really serious?
你們真的是認真的？

361
00:22:03,220 --> 00:22:05,050
Yeah, pretty much.
差不多

362
00:22:05,750 --> 00:22:08,380
You're gonna get married?
你們要結婚了？

363
00:22:09,420 --> 00:22:12,150
We're gonna be brothers-in-law! Come here!
我們要成為連襟了，過來

364
00:22:13,430 --> 00:22:16,190
And we're gonna be friends again.
我們又可以當朋友了

365
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,660
What?
什麼？

366
00:22:19,870 --> 00:22:22,770
-Water under the bridge! Forget it! -Okay.
-過去的事就別提了 -好吧

367
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:27,160
I was gonna wait till it was official, but I had to tell you guys.
我本來想等搞定再說 但我還是忍不住要告訴你們

